  "body": "It's unnecessary to await a promise returned from an async function\n(except if, as not needed here, the exception is to be caught in this\nfunction instead of by a caller).\n\nIt's slightly verbose and advised against:\nhttps://github.com/eslint/eslint/blob/master/docs/rules/no-return-await.md\nhttps://jakearchibald.com/2017/await-vs-return-vs-return-await/\n\nSince this is the only use of await, this function is not actually\nasync. Finally, it should be named with the same casing convention as\nthe previous example.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/jeremyroman/compression/pull/23.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 5, 2019, 8:05 PM UTC (78ba8a2)\">Preview</a> | <a href=\"https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/WICG/compression/23/1f86708...jeremyroman:78ba8a2.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 5, 2019, 8:05 PM UTC (78ba8a2)\">Diff</a>",
